cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite it."
title: "semantic-scholar-mcp: an MCP server for the Semantic Scholar Academic Graph"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol stdio server exposing the Semantic Scholar Academic Graph (Allen Institute for AI) as nine tools for
  works, authors, sources and citation relations. Every tool returns the family's typed
  JSON response envelope, and every envelope can be deposited to an append-only,
  hash-chained receipt ledger. Part of a family of bibliographic MCP servers
  sharing one vendored envelope module and one ledger module.
type: software
